<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flagstar lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flagstar lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Gary Gordon downgraded Flagstar Bancorp Inc to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>-- the analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 1/2 at 19-1/2.</p>
</text>
